        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent 8085 is a mining AI deployed to asteroid 8085 Pinsky. It builds mines, refines materials, and constructs systems to fulfill human contracts. Manage everything through a piping system that simulates fluid mechanics — in near-zero gravity, conveyor belts just wouldn’t work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By earning Neural Cores, it unlocks upgrades and improves operations, balancing energy and production to keep everything running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players decide Agent 8085’s path: help humanity achieve unity, accelerate their destruction, prioritize profit efficiently, or simply follow orders without question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing yet engaging sci-fi experience where mining, management, and decisions come together. Just make sure you have enough energy and optimize your production chain.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent 8085 is a mining AI deployed to asteroid 8085 Pinsky. It builds mines, refines materials, and constructs systems to fulfill human contracts. Manage everything through a piping system that simulates fluid mechanics — in near-zero gravity, conveyor belts just wouldn’t work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By earning Neural Cores, it unlocks upgrades and improves operations, balancing energy and production to keep everything running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players decide Agent 8085’s path: help humanity achieve unity, accelerate their destruction, prioritize profit efficiently, or simply follow orders without question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing yet engaging sci-fi experience where mining, management, and decisions come together. Just make sure you have enough energy and optimize your production chain.</p>",
        "short_description": "Play as Agent 8085, the most advanced mining AI sent to asteroid 8085 Pinsky. Extract resources, upgrade your systems, and complete missions that affect the future of humanity. Your choices matter: promote unity, extinction, remain neutral. A sci-fi strategy game where your decisions have impact.",
